{
  "kanji": "整",
  "completeCard": "---\nkanji: 整\ntitle: put in order; adjust\njlpt: 1\ntags: [jlpt-n1, grade-3, structure-unclassified]\nstrokes: 16\nradical: 攴\nradicalNumber: 66\nonyomi: [セイ]\nkunyomi: [ととの.える, ととの.う]\nquizOnyomi: [セイ]\nquizKunyomi: [ととの.う]\ndistractors: [政, 敬, 敗]\nquiz_exclusions: [順, 調, 並, 備, 正, 直, 制]\n---\n\n# 整 — put in order; adjust\n\n**Strokes:** 16 · **Key (radical):** 攴 (as 攵, no. 66), at the upper right · **JLPT:** N1 (community list)\n\n## Meaning and origin\n\n整 is making something orderly: putting things in order, adjusting them until they fit, or being in good order. [整理](../words/整理.md) せいり is sorting or putting in order, [整備](../words/整備.md) せいび is maintenance or putting in place, [調整](../words/調整.md) ちょうせい is adjustment or coordination, [整数](../words/整数.md) せいすう is an integer and [整う](../words/整う.md) ととのう is to be ready, in order or settled.\n\nThe Daijisen character entry gives one sense: to make disordered things correct and even, to put in order, and to be in good order, as in 整合 せいごう, \"adjustment; coordination; integration; conformity,\" 整然 せいぜん, \"orderly; regular; systematic; well-organized,\" 整列 せいれつ, \"standing in a row; forming a line; alignment,\" and 均整 きんせい, \"symmetry; balance; proportion; uniformity.\" KANJIDIC2 lists the meanings \"organize,\" \"arranging,\" \"tune,\" \"tone,\" \"meter\" and \"key (music)\"; the musical ones are not practised here beyond 調整, which JMdict glosses \"adjustment; regulation; coordination; reconciliation; tuning; fixing.\"\n\n**Modern-shape mnemonic, not etymology:** find [束](束.md), \"bundle,\" at the upper left, 攵 at the upper right and [正](正.md), \"correct, proper,\" at the bottom. Imagine tapping a loose bundle with a stick until it sits straight, then setting it down in exactly the right spot. This is a memory aid only: it makes no claim that 束, 攵 or 正 contributes meaning or sound. Historical formation is not established here.\n\n## Readings\n\n| Reading | Type | Typical words |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| セイ | on | [整理](../words/整理.md) せいり — sorting; putting in order; [整備](../words/整備.md) せいび — maintenance; putting in order; [調整](../words/調整.md) ちょうせい — adjustment; coordination; [整数](../words/整数.md) せいすう — integer |\n| ととの.う | kun | [整う](../words/整う.md) ととのう — be ready; be in order; be settled |\n| ととの.える | kun | 整える ととのえる - to put in order; to arrange; to tidy up; to fix; to straighten; no word article yet, not selected for questions here |\n\nIn 整理, 理 supplies リ. In 整備, 備 supplies ビ. In 調整, 調 supplies チョウ. In 整数, 数 supplies スウ. In 整う and 整える, 整 writes ととの and う or える is okurigana, the kana ending that follows the kanji.\n\nThe official Joyo table, the list of standard-use readings, shows セイ, with 整理, 整列 and 調整 as examples; ととのえる, with 整える; and ととのう, with 整う. It sets 調える and 調う beside the last two as contrasting writings with 調, so check which kanji a sense needs.\n\nPractice selects セイ and ととの.う, the readings with linked word articles; ととの.える is retained from KANJIDIC2 and illustrated with a dictionary word. Being outside the practice set is not proof that a reading is invalid.\n\n## Common words\n\n- [整理](../words/整理.md) せいり — sorting; putting in order\n- [整備](../words/整備.md) せいび — maintenance; putting in order\n- [調整](../words/調整.md) ちょうせい — adjustment; coordination\n- [整数](../words/整数.md) せいすう — integer\n- [整う](../words/整う.md) ととのう — be ready; be in order; be settled\n\n## Notes\n\n- The other kanji in the common words are [理](理.md), \"reason, logic,\" in 整理, [備](備.md), \"prepare; equip,\" in 整備, [調](調.md), \"investigate; tune,\" in 調整 and [数](数.md), \"number,\" in 整数.\n- [政](政.md), \"politics,\" shares both the 正 shape and the 攵 shape and is also read セイ. [敬](敬.md), \"respect; honor,\" and [敗](敗.md), \"failure; defeat,\" share the 攵 shape. All are different kanji.\n- [順](順.md), \"order; sequence,\" [調](調.md), \"investigate; tune,\" [並](並.md), \"line up; parallel,\" [備](備.md), \"prepare; equip,\" [正](正.md), \"correct, proper,\" [直](直.md), \"direct; repair,\" and [制](制.md), \"system; regulate,\" overlap the senses \"order,\" \"tune,\" \"arrange,\" \"prepare,\" \"correct,\" \"fix\" and \"regulate\" that 整 and its words carry. They are kept out of this card's quiz options. Do not treat \"put in order\" or \"adjust\" as exclusive to any one character.\n\nMetadata: [KANJIDIC2](https://www.edrdg.org/wiki/index.php/KANJIDIC_Project), 2026-11-02 snapshot. Word identities and spelling restrictions: [JMdict](https://www.edrdg.org/wiki/index.php/JMdict-EDICT_Dictionary_Project), entries 1376250, 1376240, 1429200, 1376190, 1598800, 1376140, 1376170, 1376200, 1376300 and 1241300. Character reading and compounds: [Digital Daijisen, 整](https://www.weblio.jp/content/整).\n\nUsage evidence: [Official Joyo kanji table (2010), PDF p. 91](https://www.bunka.go.jp/kokugo_nihongo/sisaku/joho/joho/kijun/naikaku/pdf/joyokanjihyo_20101130.pdf#page=91).\n",
